  "worked_solution": "To compute $-\\frac{1}{3}\\overset{\\to }{c},$ we just need to perform the required operations with each component separately:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-\\frac{1}{3}\\overset{\\to }{c} & =-\\frac{1}{3}\\cdot ⟨12,-18⟩ \\\\  & =⟨(-\\frac{1}{3})\\cdot 12,(-\\frac{1}{3})\\cdot (-18)⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-4,6⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$",
